  "description": {
   "en": "**The newest diary manga from the Harvey Award-winning creator of *My Lesbian Experience with Loneliness*.**\n\nAfter attending a friend’s wedding, Nagata Kabi decides she wants one of her own. That’s not the only thing she wants—she longs to love and be loved. But she has three major problems: she has no partner, no dating experience, and her only sexual encounters are limited to a lesbian escort service. With the help of a photoshoot, a dating app, and more, the author embarks on a journey to seek the love and happiness she so desperately desires. (Seven Seas Entertainment)"
  },
